        <div class="about-header">
          <h2 class="about-title">ABOUT</h2>
          <p class="about-desc">
SiTIO (Sistem Terpusat International Office) is a centralized, web-based information system for the International Office of Politeknik Negeri Jakarta designed to streamline the management and monitoring of official overseas travel. The platform provides data and administrative services covering both trips abroad (Outbound) and visits from abroad (Inbound). It handles end-to-end workflows, including online applications, document revisions, State Secretariat Approval Letters (SP Setneg), and Accountability Reports (LPJ). Ultimately, SiTIO makes it easier for users to access information, monitor application statuses in real time, and view data developments over specific periods while improving bureaucratic efficiency.          </p>
        </div>
</div>
